<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to Monday's 3:00 PM close, fresh loins were steady to 1.00 higher; butts 2.00 higher; skinned hams 17-20 lbs. mostly steady to 2.00 higher; 20-26 lbs. 1.00-5.00 lower; seedless bellies mostly 2.00 lower; lean trimmings 5.00-6.00 higher. Trading was moderate, with light to moderate demand and light to moderate offerings.</p>
<p>-- USDA</p>
